      "text": "Over six days, explore major archaeological sites in Yucatán and Campeche, colonial towns and natural sights in southern Mexico. Visit Tulum on the Caribbean coast, Bacalar Lagoon, Calakmul and Palenque amid tropical vegetation, and Uxmal and Chichén Itzá. Finish with a swim in the Ik Kil cenote."
